# Resume template: the "resume" example of stxt-pdf with Slots for the person, so the whole content comes in the data:
# the photo (optional), the contact lines (each one with its link, if it has one), the tools with their level, the
# languages, the key figures, the jobs and the studies. The layout and the section titles are part of the template.
# In the example, each job is two areas of one Grid, the dates and the content, and a Slot repeats a single node: here
# each job is an Area of a one-column Grid, with the two areas in a Grid of its own, and each tool, a Block with its
# name and its bar. The achievements of a job accept Markdown. resume.json has the sample data.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Paper: A4
	Title: ${name} · ${position}
	Keywords: <keywords>
	Language: en
	Section:
		Grid:
			Id: page
			Column sizes: 190 *
			Row sizes: *
			Box:
				Height: 100%
			Area:
				Block:
					Id: sidebar
					Style: side
					Image: {?photo}<file>
						Alt: <alt>
						Box:
							Width: 100%
							Corner radius: 50%
							Margin: 0 0 4 0
					Text: Contact
						Style: side-title
					Text: [contact]<text>
						Link: <?link>
					Text: Tools
						Style: side-title
					Block: [tools]
						Text: <name>
						Block:
							Style: track
							Block:
								Style: fill
								Box:
									Width: <level>
					Text: Languages
						Style: side-title
					Text: [languages]
					Text: Interests
						Style: side-title
					Paragraph: <interests>
			Area:
				Block:
					Id: main
					Box:
						Padding: 40 36 36 34
					Heading 1:
						Text: <name>
					Text: <headline>
						Typography:
							Size: 12.5
							Color: #1F7A7A
						Box:
							Margin: 2 0 14 0
					Paragraph: <profile>
						Typography:
							Align: justify
					Stack:
						Id: figures
						Gap: 10
						Box:
							Margin: 14 0 0 0
							Padding: 10 0
							Border: 0.5 0 0.5 0
							Border color: #BFD9D7
						Item: [figures]
							Grow: 1
							Block:
								Text: <value>
									Style: figure
								Text: <caption>
									Style: caption
					Heading 2:
						Text: Experience
					Grid:
						Id: jobs
						Column sizes: *
						Gap: 14
						Area: [jobs]
							Grid:
								Column sizes: 70 *
								Gap: 12
								Area:
									Text: <dates>
										Style: dates
								Area:
									Block:
										Text: <role>
											Style: role
										Text: <place>
											Style: place
										List:
											List item: [achievements]
												Text: <text>
													Typography:
														Markup: markdown
					Heading 2:
						Text: Education
					Grid:
						Id: education
						Column sizes: *
						Gap: 8
						Area: [education]
							Grid:
								Column sizes: 70 *
								Gap: 12
								Area:
									Text: <year>
										Style: dates
								Area:
									Block:
										Text: <degree>
											Style: role
										Text: <school>
											Style: place
					Heading 2:
						Text: Talks and publications
					Paragraph: <talks>
